May\t31,\t2013,\tthe\tinterest\trate\ton\tthis\tfacility\twas\t2.4%.\tThis\tfacility\tis subject\tto\tannual\treview.\n\nOn\tSeptember\t28,\t2012\twe\tentered\tinto\ta\tfive\tyear\tunsecured\t$700.0\tmillion\tterm\tloan\tagreement,\twith\ta\tsyndicate\tof\tbanks,\twhich\twe\tused\tto\tpartially\tfund\tour acquisition\tof\tAPT\tand\tour\tpurchase\tof\tHSBC\tAsia's\t44%\tinterest\tin\tGPAP\tand\tto\trepay\tthe\toutstanding\tbalance\ton\tthe\tCorporate\tCredit\tFacility.\tThe\tterm\tloan\texpires in\tSeptember\t2017\tand\tbears\tinterest,\tat\tour\telection,\tat\tthe\tprime\trate\tor\tLIBOR,\tplus\ta\tleverage\tbased\tmargin.\tAs\tof\tMay\t31,\t2013\tthe\tinterest\trate\ton\tthe\tterm\tloan was\t2.2%.\tThe\tterm\tloan\thas\tscheduled\tquarterly\tprincipal\tpayments\tof\t$17.5\tmillion\tat\tthe\tend\tof\teach\tfiscal\tquarter\tthrough\tmaturity.\tAs\t of\tMay\t31,\t2013,\tthe outstanding\tbalance\tof\tthe\tterm\tloan\twas\t$647.5\tmillion.\n\nUCS,\tour\tsubsidiary\tin\tthe\tRussian\tFederation,\thas\tnotes\tpayable\twith\ta\ttotal\toutstanding\tbalance\tof\tapproximately\t$6.0\tmillion\t at\tMay\t31,\t2013.\tThese\tnotes have\ta\tfixed\tinterest\trate\tof\t8.5%\twith\tmaturity\tdates\tranging\tfrom\tJune\t2013\tthrough\tNovember\t2016.\n\n# NOTE\t8—ACCOUNTS\tPAYABLE\tAND\tACCRUED\tLIABILITIES\n\nAs\tof\tMay\t31,\t2013\tand\t2012,\taccounts\tpayable\tand\taccrued\tliabilities\tconsisted\tof\tthe\tfollowing:\n\n|  | 2013 | 2012 |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- |\n|  | (in\\tthousands) |  |\n| Trade\\taccounts\\tpayable | $18,497 | $11,817 |\n| Compensation\\tand\\tbenefits | 39,623 | 36,116 |\n| Third-party\\tprocessing\\texpenses | 10,340 | 10,578 |\n| Commissions\\tto\\tthird\\tparties | 61,279 | 64,581 |\n| Accrued\\tfees\\tand\\tassessment\\texpenses | 30,490 | 27,149 |\n| Transition\\tservices\\tpayable\\tto\\tHSBC\\tUK,\\tHSBC\\tAsia\\tand\\tCaixaBank | 16,528 | 17,920 |\n| Accrued\\tprocessing\\tsystem\\tintrusion\\tcosts | 9,021 | 79,666 |\n| Other | 77,112 | 68,486 |\n|  